{"publicId":"a09658e1-64d9-411f-91a0-c84247597231","title":"美国联合航空全面限制AI代理完成机票预订","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T16:38:40.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-19T16:38:40.000Z","digest":"美国联合航空自2026年11月11日起全面禁止个人AI代理完成机票预订，即使乘客已授权代理操作。该政策不仅限制第三方平台（如比价工具），还覆盖联合航空自有渠道，导致用户必须通过人工操作或直接与航司合作完成交易【新】。此前联合航空允许AI代理展示航班信息、比价及显示票价，但禁止实际预订【旧】。目前Delta航空、摩根大通等企业也采取类似限制，共同针对AI代理的最终交易环节【旧】。联合航空未公开具体技术措施，仅称其政策框架符合现有规定【旧】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-19T17:44:11.198Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"联合航空禁止个人 AI 代理预订航班","latestReport":{"id":"unsbqoe073zoogxl59u7otkdv"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fKMb8o8xKPQk","title":"United Bars Personal AI Agents From Booking Flights","firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T16:38:40.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"unsbqoe073zoogxl59u7otkdv","title":"联合航空禁止个人 AI 代理预订航班","summary":"联合航空从 11 月 11 日起限制个人 AI 代理预订航班，即使乘客授权了这些代理。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T16:38:40.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"unsbqoe073zoogxl59u7otkdv","title":"联合航空禁止个人 AI 代理预订航班","summary":"联合航空从 11 月 11 日起限制个人 AI 代理预订航班，即使乘客授权了这些代理。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T16:38:40.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","heat":2.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":2.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":2.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}]}